   <!--
      G20 LCI base LED welcome light and DRL codings for FLM2 (CAFD 000043AF, built for version 016_020_000).
      Both FLM2 Left 0x43 and Right 0x44 use this CAFD. Each code says which module(s) to code it into.
      Values are raw hex, built from the factory presets in BMW's CAFD and the values tested on a US G20 LCI.
      Lmm1 is one 252-byte value, so the turn-signal experiment already contains the welcome-light change:
      code it instead of (not on top of) the welcome Lmm1 if you want both.
      Background, curve meanings and the visualizer: https://github.com/shamair28/AdvancedWelcomeLightVisualizer
      Check that your FLM2 runs this CAFD version and that your stock Lmm1 matches wert_67 before coding.
   -->
